 "subs": [
  {
   "start": 1.75,
   "end": 3.1,
   "text": "Come home…",
   "italic": true
  },
  {
   "start": 3.531,
   "end": 4.881,
   "text": "Come home…",
   "italic": true
  },
  {
   "start": 10.144,
   "end": 11.573,
   "text": "We’ll call her Senja.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 11.603,
   "end": 13.295,
   "text": "It isn’t her real name.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 13.495,
   "end": 15.874,
   "text": "She’s a young teacher, paid very little.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 16.374,
   "end": 17.775,
   "text": "The eldest child.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 17.825,
   "end": 19.109,
   "text": "When her father died,",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 19.139,
   "end": 21.168,
   "text": "the family began to lean on her.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 21.568,
   "end": 24.553,
   "text": "Her mother. Her younger siblings. Her students.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 24.753,
   "end": 26.565,
   "text": "And she has no one to tell.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 27.965,
   "end": 29.64,
   "text": "Then the whispers begin.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 29.74,
   "end": 31.023,
   "text": "Come home…",
   "italic": true
  },
  {
   "start": 31.053,
   "end": 32.819,
   "text": "Four, five times a day.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 32.919,
   "end": 34.894,
   "text": "A black shadow walks toward her.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 35.094,
   "end": 36.753,
   "text": "She covers her ears.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 36.953,
   "end": 40.031,
   "text": "Her family takes her to a psychiatric hospital.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 40.931,
   "end": 42.256,
   "text": "She is not alone.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 42.286,
   "end": 45.229,
   "text": "24 million people live with schizophrenia.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 45.259,
   "end": 47.084,
   "text": "Seven in ten hear voices.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 47.114,
   "end": 50.142,
   "text": "For up to three in ten, medicine is not enough.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 50.942,
   "end": 52.804,
   "text": "Her nurses try something simple.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 52.834,
   "end": 55.099,
   "text": "Paper. And a box of crayons.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 55.399,
   "end": 57.822,
   "text": "Day one: a tangle of black thread.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 59.122,
   "end": 62.079,
   "text": "Day two: the room around her, in careful detail.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 63.179,
   "end": 67.346,
   "text": "Day three: the mountains she used to draw as a child, with her parents.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 68.246,
   "end": 70.801,
   "text": "Nine signs of hallucination became one.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 70.901,
   "end": 73.356,
   "text": "Drawing put what was inside, outside.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 74.156,
   "end": 77.36,
   "text": "So we asked: could the voice itself be put outside?",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 77.51,
   "end": 82.345,
   "text": "When you speak, even silently, your brain sends a copy that says: this is me.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 82.445,
   "end": 85.451,
   "text": "In many people who hear voices, that copy is weak.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 85.481,
   "end": 88.29,
   "text": "Their own inner speech can sound like someone else.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 88.32,
   "end": 90.515,
   "text": "And their lips can move while they hear it.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 91.615,
   "end": 93.044,
   "text": "This is You, Yourself.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 93.074,
   "end": 95.336,
   "text": "A second way to know: this is me.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 95.736,
   "end": 98.408,
   "text": "Inside: two electrodes under the lower lip.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 98.438,
   "end": 101.922,
   "text": "A MyoWare sensor turns muscle activity into a signal.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 101.952,
   "end": 107.536,
   "text": "An ESP32 samples it 1,000 times a second, and streams it to her phone.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 107.636,
   "end": 110.628,
   "text": "Three seconds of rest set her personal baseline.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 110.678,
   "end": 114.211,
   "text": "Above the line for 300 milliseconds: speech muscles.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 114.241,
   "end": 115.167,
   "text": "Not a swallow.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 115.197,
   "end": 116.543,
   "text": "Not chewing.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 116.573,
   "end": 120.072,
   "text": "Outside: the microphone checks if anyone is really speaking.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 120.102,
   "end": 121.723,
   "text": "Nothing is recorded.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 121.773,
   "end": 124.25,
   "text": "Two channels. One gentle answer.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 124.85,
   "end": 126.915,
   "text": "Now imagine Senja, with it.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 127.315,
   "end": 128.298,
   "text": "Come home…",
   "italic": true
  },
  {
   "start": 128.328,
   "end": 129.76,
   "text": "Her lips move, barely.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 129.79,
   "end": 131.453,
   "text": "No one else is speaking.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 133.553,
   "end": 135.76,
   "text": "Two soft taps. This is you.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 135.86,
   "end": 137.679,
   "text": "She hums one soft note,",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 139.679,
   "end": 141.478,
   "text": "and the voice grows quiet.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 141.678,
   "end": 145.627,
   "text": "Each moment is saved in a diary, for her doctors and nurses.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 146.227,
   "end": 147.367,
   "text": "It’s not a cure.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 147.397,
   "end": 149.403,
   "text": "It reads muscles, never thoughts.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 149.433,
   "end": 151.297,
   "text": "Everything stays on her phone.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 154.947,
   "end": 157.502,
   "text": "Senja found her way home with crayons.",
   "italic": false
  },
  {
   "start": 158.002,
   "end": 159.352,
   "text": "Come home…",
   "italic": true
  }
 ]
}